{"seq":1,"slug":"mas-paradigm","title":"多智能体范式与动机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/foundations/mas-paradigm","wordCount":1854,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"多智能体范式与动机\">多智能体范式与动机</h1><p>2025 年 6 月，Anthropic 在工程博客上公布了其多智能体研究系统（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/multi-agent-research-system\">How we built our multi-agent research system</a>，2025-06-13）：一个主导智能体派生多个子智能体并行检索，把复杂研究任务的表现拉高了九成；几乎同一时期，Cognition 的工程博客<a href=\"https://cognition.ai/blog/dont-build-multi-agents\">《Don&#39;t Build Multi-Agents》</a>却旗帜鲜明地警告「不要轻易构建多智能体系统」，因为子智能体之间共享上下文一旦断裂，最终产物就会自相矛盾。这两种看似对立的声音，恰恰圈出了多智能体范式真正的问题：它不是「越多越好」的能力叠加，而是一场协调收益与协调代价的精打细算。这一篇要立起来的，正是这把贯穿全 hub 的标尺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>智能体（agent）是一个能感知环境、自主决策并采取行动以达成目标的实体。在大模型语境下，它通常是「大模型 + 工具调用 + 记忆 + 循环控制」的组合。<strong>多智能体系统</strong>（Multi-Agent System, MAS）则是多个这样的智能体在同一环境中交互、协调、共同或竞争地完成任务的系统。</p>\n<p>判断要不要从单体走向多体，本质是回答一个不等式是否成立：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mtext>MAS</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>分工</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>并行</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>互查</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>协调</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>级联</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mtext>单体</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{\\text{MAS}} = B_{\\text{分工}} + B_{\\text{并行}} + B_{\\text{互查}} - C_{\\text{协调}} - C_{\\text{级联}} &gt; U_{\\text{单体}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MAS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">分工</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">并行</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">互查</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">协调</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">级联</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">单体</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是多智能体带来的收益，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是它引入的代价。只有当右边显著大于单体方案时，多智能体才值得做。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[一个任务] --&gt; B{需要多专业?&lt;br/&gt;需要并行?&lt;br/&gt;需要互查?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[单智能体&lt;br/&gt;+工具+记忆]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D{协调收益&lt;br/&gt;是否压过&lt;br/&gt;协调代价?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| C&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[多智能体系统]&#10;  E --&gt; F[分工专业化]&#10;  E --&gt; G[并行推进]&#10;  E --&gt; H[互相审查纠错]\">graph TD\n  A[一个任务] --&gt; B{需要多专业?&lt;br/&gt;需要并行?&lt;br/&gt;需要互查?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[单智能体&lt;br/&gt;+工具+记忆]\n  B --&gt;|是| D{协调收益&lt;br/&gt;是否压过&lt;br/&gt;协调代价?}\n  D --&gt;|否| C\n  D --&gt;|是| E[多智能体系统]\n  E --&gt; F[分工专业化]\n  E --&gt; G[并行推进]\n  E --&gt; H[互相审查纠错]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>单智能体</th>\n<th>多智能体系统</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>上下文</td>\n<td>单一长上下文，易稀释</td>\n<td>每体聚焦自身职责，上下文干净</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行性</td>\n<td>串行为主</td>\n<td>子任务可真正并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容错</td>\n<td>单点错误直达输出</td>\n<td>可通过互查拦截，但也可能级联放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试难度</td>\n<td>一条轨迹，相对可读</td>\n<td>多体交互，归因困难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用任务</td>\n<td>边界清晰、深度优先</td>\n<td>可分解、广度优先、需多视角</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多智能体相对单体的四类收益\">多智能体相对单体的四类收益</h2><p><strong>分工与专业化</strong>是最直接的收益。把一个无所不包的巨型提示拆成规划者、检索者、编码者、审查者，每个智能体只需在窄领域内表现优秀，提示更短、工具集更小、行为更可预测。这一点在<a href=\"../collaboration/role-specialization\">角色分工与专业化</a>里展开。</p>\n<p><strong>并行性</strong>让广度优先的任务真正加速。研究、检索、多文件改写这类任务天然可切分，多个智能体同时推进，墙钟时间大幅下降——Anthropic 的研究系统正是靠这一点取得九成提升。</p>\n<p><strong>互相审查与纠错</strong>引入了单体没有的容错维度。生成者—审查者、辩论、投票等模式让错误在到达用户前被另一个智能体拦截，相关机制见<a href=\"../collaboration/negotiation-consensus\">协商与共识</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>可扩展与可演化</strong>：模块化的智能体可以独立替换、独立升级，新增能力只需加一个智能体而非重写整个提示，系统随业务生长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多智能体引入的三类代价\">多智能体引入的三类代价</h2><p><strong>协调开销</strong>是首要代价。智能体之间要通信、要对齐、要等待彼此，这些都不直接产出价值。通信本身的形式与成本，是<a href=\"agent-communication\">智能体通信与协议</a>的主题。</p>\n<p><strong>级联错误</strong>是最隐蔽的杀手。一个智能体在第二步给出的错误工具调用，会污染依赖它的每一个后续步骤；自然语言的模糊性让错误更容易悄悄传播。这正是<a href=\"../systems/evaluation-debugging\">评估与调试</a>要专门对付的难题。</p>\n<p><strong>上下文断裂与不一致</strong>：当子智能体各自持有部分上下文、又缺乏共享状态时，它们的产物可能彼此矛盾——这是 Cognition 警告的核心。解法往往是引入共享记忆或单线程编排，见<a href=\"../collaboration/orchestration-patterns\">编排模式</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"范式谱系-从分布式-ai-到大模型智能体\">范式谱系：从分布式 AI 到大模型智能体</h2><p>多智能体不是大模型时代的新发明。它的根脉是 1980 年代的<strong>分布式人工智能</strong>（DAI），关注如何让多个计算实体协同求解。这一传统沉淀出两套至今仍在用的核心思想：一是形式化的通信语义（KQML、FIPA-ACL），二是经典的协调架构（黑板、合同网、市场机制），后者是<a href=\"coordination-models\">协调模型</a>的主体。</p>\n<p>进入 2010 年代，<strong>多智能体强化学习</strong>（MARL）让智能体从「人编排」转向「自主习得」协调策略，相关算法见<a href=\"../emergence/marl\">多智能体强化学习</a>。而 2023 年后，大模型把每个智能体的「大脑」从专用策略换成了通用语言模型，催生了 AutoGen、CrewAI、LangGraph 等一批新框架，详见<a href=\"../systems/llm-multi-agent\">大模型多智能体框架</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式阶段</th>\n<th>智能体的「大脑」</th>\n<th>协调来源</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分布式 AI（1980s）</td>\n<td>专家系统/规则</td>\n<td>人工设计协议</td>\n<td>黑板、合同网</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多智能体 RL（2010s）</td>\n<td>学习的策略网络</td>\n<td>训练中习得</td>\n<td>MADDPG、QMIX</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大模型智能体（2023+）</td>\n<td>通用语言模型</td>\n<td>提示+编排+协议</td>\n<td>AutoGen、LangGraph</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"拓扑-智能体如何连成系统\">拓扑：智能体如何连成系统</h2><p>同样是「多个智能体」，它们连接的拓扑结构决定了系统的性格。常见的几种拓扑各有取舍，理解它们能帮你在动机阶段就预判协调代价的量级。</p>\n<p><strong>星形（中心化）</strong>：一个中心智能体连接所有外围智能体，外围之间不直接通信。它把协调集中在中心，最易调试、信息流最清晰，但中心是瓶颈与单点——这是<a href=\"coordination-models\">协调模型</a>里主从结构的拓扑表达。<strong>网状（去中心化）</strong>：智能体两两可通信，灵活、无单点，但连接数随智能体数平方增长，协调开销与归因难度急剧上升。<strong>链式（流水线）</strong>：智能体串成一条线，上游喂下游，控制流最简单，但任一环卡住全线停摆，错误沿链级联。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拓扑</th>\n<th>连接复杂度</th>\n<th>协调代价</th>\n<th>单点风险</th>\n<th>调试难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>星形</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（中心）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网状</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链式</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中（任一环）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>拓扑选择直接影响那个核心不等式里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>协调</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{协调}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">协调</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 项：网状拓扑的协调代价随规模平方膨胀，意味着智能体一多就极易让协调代价反超收益。这也是为什么实践中星形（监督者）拓扑最常见——它把协调代价压在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这些拓扑如何落成可运行的控制流，是<a href=\"../collaboration/orchestration-patterns\">编排模式</a>的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多智能体系统是多个自主智能体在同一环境交互协调的系统，核心标尺是「协调收益是否压过协调代价」，而非能力的简单叠加。</li>\n<li>四类收益：分工专业化、并行加速、互相审查、可扩展演化；三类代价：协调开销、级联错误、上下文断裂。</li>\n<li>不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mtext>MAS</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mtext>单体</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{\\text{MAS}} &gt; U_{\\text{单体}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MAS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">单体</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是决定要不要上多智能体的根本判据；很多任务用增强的单体更划算。</li>\n<li>范式有三段谱系：分布式 AI（人编排协议）、多智能体 RL（训练习得协调）、大模型智能体（提示+编排+协议），后续章节分别深入。</li>\n<li>这把标尺贯穿全 hub：通信、协调、协作、涌现、框架、评估，每一块都在回答「这点协调代价值不值」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/multi-agent-research-system\">Anthropic Engineering: How we built our multi-agent research system（2025-06）</a>、<a href=\"https://cognition.ai/blog/dont-build-multi-agents\">Cognition: Don&#39;t Build Multi-Agents（2025-06）</a></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多智能体范式与动机","id":"多智能体范式与动机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"多智能体相对单体的四类收益","id":"多智能体相对单体的四类收益"},{"level":2,"text":"多智能体引入的三类代价","id":"多智能体引入的三类代价"},{"level":2,"text":"范式谱系：从分布式 AI 到大模型智能体","id":"范式谱系-从分布式-ai-到大模型智能体"},{"level":2,"text":"拓扑：智能体如何连成系统","id":"拓扑-智能体如何连成系统"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"智能体通信与协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multi-agent-systems/foundations/agent-communication"}}